        <mxCell id="legenda" value="&lt;b&gt;Legenda e notas de implantação&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#438DD5&quot;&gt;&amp;#9632;&lt;/font&gt; Container da aplicação&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Ícones = serviços gerenciados AWS&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;#8594; conexão de rede com porta/protocolo&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Security group da subnet privada libera 5432 apenas para o SG do EC2&lt;br&gt;• Segredos no SSM Parameter Store, injetados no Docker Compose no deploy&lt;br&gt;• Deploy: GitHub Actions → imagem → SSH no EC2 → docker compose up&lt;br&gt;• Risco: API e worker no mesmo EC2 competem por CPU no pico (ver hotspot H1)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#B3B3B3;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
